        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love word games? 🧠 Test your luck and language skills with the classic Hangman game, now available on your mobile!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔠 How to Play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess the correct word by suggesting letters before time runs out and your attempts are over. But be careful – every wrong guess brings you closer to defeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Play Solo or with Friends – Choose single-player or multiplayer mode and challenge other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Different Difficulty Levels – From simple words for beginners to challenging puzzles for experts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Online Mode – Play with friends through an internet connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Variety of Word Categories – From everyday words to themed challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Leaderboards &amp; Achievements – Earn chips as you compete with other palyers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Fully in English! 🇬🇧 (Supports Greek as well!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📲 Download now for free and start playing! Are you ready to become the ultimate Hangman champion?</p>",
